# A new chat from 令 and its first words sent (newchat.mbt, flight.mbt carried): they stay where they were typed while
# the chat is made, then go up into their bubble with the chat's list coming up out of the composer, the new chat's
# scene going up and out. With MBUI_CORE_MS the core answers as late as a phone's.
timeout 20000
until 整理发布清单
wait 600
tap icon:ling
wait 900
tap 做任何事
wait 500
type 把发布说明写一下
wait 700
tap icon:arrow-up
wait 2500
